GStreamer @_version@

QGroundControl includes GStreamer (https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org) libraries and plugins. GStreamer is free
software, licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later); LGPL-2.1.txt
next to this file holds the license text. Some GStreamer plugins, and the libraries they use, are under other licenses;
each plugin declares its license, which gst-inspect-1.0 <plugin> shows.

